u saying that joining the Drinkers automatically strips away Auspice like what happens with the Pure? I kinda got that sense from some of the writeup, but I'd always interpreted it as Forsaken can join and keep their Auspice; if a Pure joins, they get this Hunter's Aspect. Doesn't matter either way, just wanna make sure we're on the same page. <br /> <br /> Also, I know there are lots of people looking for a Werewolf game in some of the Discords I'm in. Do you mind if I share the link around?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-11T15:35:16-07:00","id":1413118,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1413096-werewolf-the-forsaken-discord-pbp-wolves-of-the-ozarks?p=1413116#post1413116\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, so quick question on character creation: Are you saying that joining the Drinkers automatically strips away Auspice like what happens with the Pure? I kinda got that sense from some of the writeup, but I'd always interpreted it as Forsaken can join and keep their Auspice; if a Pure joins, they get this Hunter's Aspect. Doesn't matter either way, just wanna make sure we're on the same page.<br /> <br /> Also, I know there are lots of people looking for a Werewolf game in some of the Discords I'm in. Do you mind if I share the link around?</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, no, Forsaken who join the Drinkers keep their Auspice. The &quot;Newly Pure&quot; character idea is just suggesting a particular Forsaken who, after joining, decided to turn Anshega.<br /> <br /> I don't mind if you share it around, though as this is my first time actually running a game of Werewolf, I'd like to keep the final play group relatively contained (three to five players I think would be ideal).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"",